{
  "title": "创建方法",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  \n  <h1>创建方法</h1>\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    <ol>\n      <li class=\"Numbered\">在导航窗格中点击 <strong>Administration&gt;Methods</strong>。出现以下菜单：</li>\n    </ol>\n    <p class=\"Figure_indented\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/aras-images/methodmenu.jpg\"></p>\n    <ol start=\"2\">\n      <li class=\"Numbered\">点击 <strong>Create New Method</strong>（创建新方法）。出现方法窗口：</li>\n    </ol>\n    <p><img alt=\"\" height=\"389\" src=\"/aras-images/methodwindow.jpg\" style=\"cursor: nwse-resize;\" width=\"884\"></p>\n    <p class=\"Content_body_indented\">有关使用和创建方法的信息，请参阅《Aras Innovator 程序员指南》。</p>\n    <ol start=\"3\">\n      <li class=\"Numbered\">点击 <img src=\"/aras-images/done.jpg\"> 图标以保存并释放方法。新的动作现在将出现在主窗口的默认页面中。</li>\n    </ol>\n    \n    \n    <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n      <p><img src=\"/aras-images/blurmethod.jpg\"><br>\n        \n      </p>\n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "Creating_a_Method.htm"
}